content.text:
I created the coupler inspection for `loco-4419` (got `insp-7c2e-2203`), but the v2 work-orders endpoint consistently returned `422 missing_required` for `inspection_id` across every body format and path I tried. As a fallback, I opened a work order via the deprecated v1 endpoint, which returned a work order ID but explicitly notes it has no inspection linkage.

```json
{
  "work_order_id": "wo-legacy-0001"
}
```
